# kmdots

Oneliner below clones the repo, makes the installer executable, and runs it. Pick your poison GitHub or Codeberg, same repo.

### GitHub

```sh
git clone https://github.com/kurai-murasaki/kmdots.git ~/.kmdots && chmod +x ~/.kmdots/install.sh && ~/.kmdots/install.sh
```

### Codeberg

```sh
git clone https://codeberg.org/0x6b6d/kmdots.git ~/.kmdots && chmod +x ~/.kmdots/install.sh && ~/.kmdots/install.sh
```